WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.268 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.103 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alright! That's really good,
for a Thursday.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.705 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden announced
sanctions

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
and other measures
against Russia today,

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
in response to cyber attacks
and election meddling.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:16.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, you have made
a powerful enemy today.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.684 line:92%
No, no, no, the other one.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.518 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, there you go.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.922
he will withdraw all U.S. troops
from Afghanistan

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.190 line:92%
by September 11th and said

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
"It's time to end
America's longest war,

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
but don't cry
because it's over, Dick.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.765 line:92%
Smile because it happened.

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden met
in the Oval Office today

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the Congressional
Asian/Pacific American Caucu

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.472
to discuss diversifying th
administration. Said Biden -

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Biden ]
That's perfect,
because I actually know

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:44.577 size:78% position:39%
a great Hawaiian guy
I would love to hire.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:45.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.312 line:92%
Just keep getting his voicemail.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Vice President Kamala Harris
said yesterday

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
she will travel
to Guatemala and Mexico

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
to address the ongoing
immigration crisis.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:56.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
She intends to find out,
once and for all,

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
how people like Ted Cruz
keep getting back in.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:01.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
House Minority Whip
Steve Scalise

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
brought a milk carton
to the Capitol yesterday

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a picture
of Vice President Kamala Harri

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:09.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the caption "missing at th
border" on the side.

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:10.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's kind of the perfect
punishment for him

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he had to spend all day
explaining the joke.

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:16.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You see When kids went missin
in the '70s, they would --

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:18.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I'm not making fun
of missing kids.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.313
You know what? Never mind.
I shouldn't have done it.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Never mind.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
Infectious disease expert
Dr. Anthony Fauci

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.384 line:92%
testified today before the

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:27.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
House Select Subcommittee
on the Coronavirus pandemic,

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:30.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
which the Democrat-led panel
has entitled,

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Reaching the Light
at the End of the Tunnel:

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:36.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
a Science-Driven Approach
to Swiftly and Safely
Ending the Pandemic,"

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:37.997 line:92%
and Republicans are calling,

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:40.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Question Time with Dr. Fakey.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
Democratic lawmakers today
introduced legislation

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
that would add four seats
to the Supreme Court.

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:48.541
Of course, if they do that
you know Clarence Thomas

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.343 size:81% position:41%
is just going to sleep
across three of them.

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Toy company Mattel
announced yesterday

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
they've banned
over 400 racial slurs

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.217 line:92%
from the board game Scrabble

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:58.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
which really
won't affect my game,

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.321 line:92%
unless this is a racial slur

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:01.955 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
Netflix announced yesterda
a partnership

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the meditation app
headspace,

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:09.896
to create a new series that will
teach subscribers how to sleep

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:13.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, pretty sure my wife
already made us watch that one

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.468 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I said what I said.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.503 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
Producers have released
a trailer

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.272 line:92%
for the newest installment

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the "Fast and the Furious
series,

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:24.277 line:92%
called "F9: The Fast Saga.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:27.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
Interestingly, if you hit F9
on your computer,

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:31.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
it will write another
"Fast and Furious" screenplay.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.051 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today was International
Pizza Cake Day

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I know they say
it's international,

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:38.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, I feel like
it's just American.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.927
[ Laughter ]
And, finally, today was alsho --

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
was also -- excuse me --
National Ask an Atheist Day.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.866 size:81% position:41% line:92%
The other 364 days are

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
They'll Tell You Anyway Day.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

